sequenceDiagram
  actor Manager
  actor Admin
  actor Resident
  participant UnitsController
  participant UnitRepo

  Admin->>UnitsController: POST /api/condominiums/{id}/units
  Note over UnitsController: Route condominiumId must match access scope.
  UnitsController->>UnitRepo: Add unit
  UnitRepo-->>UnitsController: persisted unit
  UnitsController-->>Admin: 201 Created

  Admin->>UnitsController: GET /api/condominiums/{id}/units/paged
  UnitsController->>UnitRepo: GetAll and filter by condominiumId
  UnitRepo-->>UnitsController: condominium units
  UnitsController-->>Admin: 200 OK paged

  Manager->>UnitsController: GET /api/condominiums/{id}/units
  Note over UnitsController: Manager bypasses condominium claim restriction.
  UnitsController->>UnitRepo: GetAll and filter by route condominiumId
  UnitsController-->>Manager: 200 OK

  Resident->>UnitsController: GET /api/condominiums/{id}/units/{unitId}
  Note over UnitsController: Must belong to same condominium.
  UnitsController-->>Resident: 200 OK or 403/404
